flowchart LR
  A[Developer or agent] --> B[Feature branch]
  B --> C[Pull request]
  C --> D[Policy gates]
  C --> E[Quality gates]
  C --> F[Security gates]
  C --> G[Accessibility and responsive gates]
  D --> H[Protected main]
  E --> H
  F --> H
  G --> H
  H --> I[Immutable tested artifact]
  I --> J[Staging approval]
  J --> K[Staging verification]
  K --> L[Production approval]
  L --> M[Production deploy]
  M --> N[Post-deploy verification]
  N --> O[Evidence and audit]
  N --> P[Rollback when unhealthy]
